{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STOCKWAVE ONLINE is a high-octane, player-vs-player stock trading game about violently murdering your co-workers in order to assume workplace dominance, and ultimate wealth. Traders are tasked with making as much money as possible by profiting through the dynamic stock market system. A curated list of companies ready to excel with your financial support. Just follow that simple task, and you'll have a shot at the company big leagues.<br><br>You\u2019ll know you\u2019re doing well when other employees start to want a piece of that profit too.<br><br>When dealing in wealth and status, some might get bloodthirsty. Some might go as far as to rip you apart. If your packing some stocks on your person, then you might just want to gather some office supplies, and get working on a defence. Our employees might just take your investments directly from your corpse.<br><br>Unless you become that &quot;Employee&quot;.<br> <br> Features: <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/39188d906c3f9b3dc9cf1857a93643d3.poster.avif?t=1772840933\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/39188d906c3f9b3dc9cf1857a93643d3.webm?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/39188d906c3f9b3dc9cf1857a93643d3.mp4?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Players get thrust into an inescapable office environment with a goal: Be the wealthiest worker there. Buy and Sell stocks to earn cash, in the hopes of making more money than your co-workers. So buy low, and sell high. The problems arise when other players get violent, since there is only you stand in the way between your oppositions murdering you in cold blood for your stocks. They can try to take your whole pot.\u00a0The more you invest, the more they can take. That also applies to them.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/1c88c3e98db7e8d29ad59d22c44cf8f6.poster.avif?t=1772840933\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/1c88c3e98db7e8d29ad59d22c44cf8f6.webm?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/1c88c3e98db7e8d29ad59d22c44cf8f6.mp4?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Everyone gets access to the stock traders' web, where you can buy and sell your acquired assets. Wait for a Stockwave event to appear, and all stock value progresses. This is the core of money making, along with protecting these purchased assets from prying hands looking to leverage them from you. The best stock-trader by the end can claim their title of: &quot;Employee of the Month&quot;, and a hefty bonus.     <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/4759edb2045cd750b94eb38b32fe67e2.poster.avif?t=1772840933\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/4759edb2045cd750b94eb38b32fe67e2.webm?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/4759edb2045cd750b94eb38b32fe67e2.mp4?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>STOCKWAVE ONLINE uses a fast-paced and high-octane combat system. Getting you deeply involved in the blood and sweat of action. Use the tools around you to batter enemies across the map, and stain the environment around you in their blood. It isn't the prettiest sight, but nothing can stand in the way of fortune.    <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/ec2db37765f4059d5ff2b0f79f96eef3.poster.avif?t=1772840933\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/ec2db37765f4059d5ff2b0f79f96eef3.webm?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/ec2db37765f4059d5ff2b0f79f96eef3.mp4?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Collect resources in the environment to craft and utilize weapons of mass destruction. Build up defences with traps, weapons and gear. Or, craft up a strategy to hunt, stalk, and prey on your competition. A large world of items and resources almost asks you to loot it.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/8010f4cf4119eee906038ab891a49b6d.poster.avif?t=1772840933\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/8010f4cf4119eee906038ab891a49b6d.webm?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/8010f4cf4119eee906038ab891a49b6d.mp4?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>We built around strategy. Balancing systems to make a variety of different approaches viable in the long-term. Along with completely random stock-trading effects and item rotations, all games put players on a level field, focusing on what you decide to do with the world around you. Take advantage of these elements.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/243e5ea5761f2d66f8271b4f2bf6ab7b.poster.avif?t=1772840933\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/243e5ea5761f2d66f8271b4f2bf6ab7b.webm?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/243e5ea5761f2d66f8271b4f2bf6ab7b.mp4?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Up to 8 players across the globe can join a shift at one time. Leading to a chaotic free-for-all experience. Fist your friends across different maps and game-modes  from the comfort of your own home, or take on a class of strangers and assert your name as the greatest investor of all trader-kind.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/cab5aa60240b0004a60a04e6ae5b2d87.poster.avif?t=1772840933\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/cab5aa60240b0004a60a04e6ae5b2d87.webm?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844530/extras/cab5aa60240b0004a60a04e6ae5b2d87.mp4?t=1772840933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With that extra cash from your &quot;Employee of the month&quot; checks, you may want to head down the store and buy some fashionable cosmetic items. (Using the earn-able in-game currency). Open briefcases in game to unlock new suits, hats, sprays and more! Show off your swagger and wealth.  <br> <br>Fulfil the economy, and your lust for blood! Become a stock-trader today!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Back to work again","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s